<http://data.silknow.org/object/400e6279-cf72-3702-bd93-231174edaf09>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Fichu of embroidered muslin with silk thread, England, 1730-1769"@en , "Fichu of white embroidered muslin with white thread in a flowing design of stylised flowers and leaves from which spring small sprays of five-petalled flowers at intervals. Border of rococo scrolls and scallops. The design is worked in drawn fabric stitches, chain stitch and shadow work. In the centre is a triangle of white silk muslin. The embroidered border is joined to the centre panel by buttonholing. The top of the fichu is finished off with a rolled hem."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/eb5cf563-d8f6-378c-9155-efe28746d155> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Fichu of embroidered muslin with silk thread, England, 1730-1769"@en , "Fichu of white embroidered muslin with white thread in a flowing design of stylised flowers and leaves from which spring small sprays of five-petalled flowers at intervals. Border of rococo scrolls and scallops. The design is worked in drawn fabric stitches, chain stitch and shadow work. In the centre is a triangle of white silk muslin. The embroidered border is joined to the centre panel by buttonholing. The top of the fichu is finished off with a rolled hem."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/400e6279-cf72-3702-bd93-231174edaf09/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/400e6279-cf72-3702-bd93-231174edaf09/dimension/1> ;
